</section>

<!-- Stage 3 · beat: a real trace -->
<section class="slide beat">
  <div class="beat-l">
    <div class="kicker">Stage 3 · Autonomy</div>
    <div class="swap">
      <h2 class="h2" data-step="0" data-out="8">Watch one<br />swap <em>happen</em>.</h2>
      <h2 class="h2" data-step="8">Nobody scripted<br />these <em>steps</em>.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="note" data-step="4">Each step is chosen from what it just saw. Size 42 sold out? It changes plan — and asks.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="beat-r">
    <div class="trace">
      <div class="row" data-step="1"><span class="i">1</span><code>get_order(4821)</code><span>delivered Thu · size 41</span></div>
      <div class="row" data-step="2"><span class="i">2</span><code>check_return_policy(4821)</code><span>can return · 9 days left</span></div>
      <div class="row warn" data-step="3"><span class="i">3</span><code>check_stock("Air Run", 42)</code><span>sold out</span></div>
      <div class="row" data-step="4"><span class="i">4</span><code>check_stock("Air Run", 42.5)</code><span>3 left</span></div>
      <div class="row ask" data-step="5"><span class="i">?</span><code>ask_customer(…)</code><span>“42.5 instead?” → “yes”</span></div>
      <div class="row" data-step="6"><span class="i">5</span><code>create_exchange(4821, 42.5)</code><span>exchange EX-311 created</span></div>
      <div class="row" data-step="7"><span class="i">6</span><code>create_return_label(4821)</code><span>label emailed</span></div>
      <div class="reply" data-step="8">“All set! Your return label is in your inbox. The 42.5 ships as soon as we scan the return.”</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Stage 3 · beat: the price of freedom -->
<section class="slide beat">
  <div class="beat-l">
    <div class="kicker">Stage 3 · Autonomy</div>
    <h2 class="h2">Freedom has<br />a <em class="r">price</em>.</h2>
    <p class="note">A loop decides for itself how long to run. That's the point — and the problem.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="beat-r">
    <div class="trio">
      <div class="card" data-step="1">
        <div class="ico">∞</div>
        <div class="h3">When does it stop?</div>
        <p class="note">The shipping API stops responding. The agent retries. And retries.</p>
        <p class="small mono">→ step limits · timeouts</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" data-step="2">
        <div class="ico">6×</div>
        <div class="h3">Every round costs</div>
        <p class="note">Six steps = six LLM calls. Money and waiting time grow each round.</p>
        <p class="small mono">→ budgets · faster models</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" data-step="3">
        <div class="ico fillbar"><i></i></div>
        <div class="h3">The window fills up</div>
        <p class="note">Every result is added to the history. Long chats overflow.</p>
        <p class="small mono c-acc">→ Stage 4</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

